./skills/report-tokens/scripts/run-analysis.md:33:- `larch-logs/implement/*/token-report.json` — structured token data; runs without it are skipped.
./skills/report-tokens/scripts/run-analysis.md:34:- `larch-logs/implement/*/timing-report.json` — preferred workflow path source via `.workflow_path`.
