./skills/design/references/plan-review.md:69:**Ballot file handling**: Use the Write tool (not `cat` with heredoc or Bash) to write the ballot to `$DESIGN_TMPDIR/ballot.txt`. For Codex and Cursor voter prompts, reference the ballot file path (e.g., "Read the ballot from $DESIGN_TMPDIR/ballot.txt") instead of inlining the ballot content. This avoids permission prompts from `cat > file << 'EOF'` or `BALLOT=$(cat file)` patterns.
