./larch-logs/implement/F17F9ABF-B557-43F7-A91C-32CE430C0533/round-1/cursor-specialist-structure-output-ns-retry.txt:50:1	in_scope	important	risk-integration	skills/review-and-fix/scripts/review-and-fix.md:95-105 vs skills/implement/SKILL.md:1366-1398	DEGRADED_ROUND documented for cap accounting but SKILL Step 5 never reads it.	At round cap a degraded panel still consumes a round toward the cap; operator expectation from docs is not met.	Parse DEGRADED_ROUND in Step 5 (and/or launcher) to avoid incrementing round_num toward round_cap on degraded rounds.
