./larch-logs/implement/4996FA45-2A9E-43DB-8845-BD43355682A1/round-2/dyn-test-assertion-quality-output.txt:11:- **risk-integration** `larch-logs/implement/4996FA45-2A9E-43DB-8845-BD43355682A1:1-` — The branch diff adds a full `/implement` run tree slice (`manifest.json`, `parent-issue.md`, `plan-goals-test.md`, `plan-review-tally.json`) alongside the verifier hardening work, which widens the shipped surface and couples unrelated operational metadata to a security-hardening change unless that flush is an intentional, separately motivated chore. **Suggested fix:** If the PR goal is only manifest-path validation, drop or relocate those run-log files per repo run-log policy; if the flush is intentional, isolate it in its own commit/PR with a clear rationale so reviewers can gate it independently.
