codex
I’ve found the core mismatch: `/design` is prompt-orchestrated through `skills/design/SKILL.md`, while the reusable log commit helper currently assumes implement-style commit semantics and no PR lifecycle. I’m checking the PR/merge helpers next because the cleanest design may be to reuse existing hardened scripts rather than hand-author `gh` calls in the skill prompt.
exec
/bin/bash -lc 'rg -n "Step 5|plan-block-write|cleanup-tmpdir|DESIGN_COMPLETE|tracking-issue-write|larch-log|token-report|timing-report" skills/design/SKILL.md' in <OPERATOR_REPO_PATH>
